#: scenario3:scenario3_8E835108_88C9_4B53_89FB_A4E068E8C664
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1954a07d66b95d60ab8fdfae84e3f88aa76b83014532cef335b157ec0ed6b1ef
#. default-sha256: 45e51d2746f595dfca02c9742de20933d60e711813e808beff1d6388e4af73f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8E835108_88C9_4B53_89FB_A4E068E8C664"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“That era was a rat race of innovation and development.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Aquela era foi como uma contenda de inovação e desenvolvimento.”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DD8990AD_4FB5_43EB_8F10_572DDD636643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a926bcf1078fddaa71d41040823a4665268854d63bbe69bea86f5e3589372f30
#. default-sha256: 6d7f20a4392628aeb347b2e99ab66eb6e41f13021d8e9249863107db7a211dab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DD8990AD_4FB5_43EB_8F10_572DDD636643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The smoke was so thick you could hardly see more than a few feet "
"ahead of you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A fumaça era tão espessa que mal dava para ver mais do que alguns "
"metros à sua frente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD7ED951_99CE_419B_906E_75A964095B30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d31ba2837367947b7c84c906418cdf664ae16697c7b66366beb8eae3acd1ab94
#. default-sha256: daf9a5603f818a672e9a19bae6b8a3537434380b3d3e3a336b13adb4f916b72f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD7ED951_99CE_419B_906E_75A964095B30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could compare it to a dense morning fog, but that might give the impression of beauty, and "
"there was little of that to be found in this haze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu poderia compará-la a uma densa neblina matinal, mas isso poderia dar a impressão de "
"beleza, e havia pouco disso para ser encontrado nessa bruma."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C4A147A4_4735_4E91_B7A4_AE00AB086695
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 008136429a681b0adb8841a545545de26fcdc7aae01905965b29bfcd0f160849
#. default-sha256: 69b025e1be730c64fdd34337f5e7ee2329ef822faef4bbf65fc8612e59de8937
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C4A147A4_4735_4E91_B7A4_AE00AB086695"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you see the silhouettes of several men in the smoky room? The one in the middle..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você vê as silhuetas de vários homens na sala esfumaçada? Aquele do meio..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_843D93F7_18AB_4BE1_ACC4_686F23490B2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90b667863c46159622147e3718f3938ef52d11bff0fe7c3603c5ea8a03be021b
#. default-sha256: 3b618d6440fe5cb98535d26fc6e8a2227c862b392de016cb64aca2b5caa4cdda
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_843D93F7_18AB_4BE1_ACC4_686F23490B2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the one looking in your direction, Master, was the present master of the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫aquele que está olhando na sua direção, Mestre, era o atual dono da casa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_33DC9683_41A1_4B38_8DD8_15B0F4734997
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88c9b049339db655aa04ee559f7a8a1620a66832af1a7583a1ced241712fa3fc
#. default-sha256: 63baf8732078c8d9f568a211b92dd8612ae01481895013842545d335229815ec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_33DC9683_41A1_4B38_8DD8_15B0F4734997"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫........................."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C61C8685_DE37_47A8_8269_793AFBD5A568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14a79fc4c75d43e85da265a147a0d369b57eee90fb294be31231d11241a0800b
#. default-sha256: ace5d0a4a15e2634f822a725b6ae18f5f91cd017715703ce2f498755840463a5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C61C8685_DE37_47A8_8269_793AFBD5A568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His name was Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫And though he dressed in such fine attire, I sincerely doubt he "
"understood how splendid the furnishings left in the mansion truly were."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seu nome era Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫ E embora ele se vestisse com roupas tão finas, sinceramente "
"duvido que ele entendesse quão esplêndidos eram os móveis deixados na mansão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4F66D0E7_51E8_426F_BC2E_44990B4B075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf295c138f72cf42b7b6ad36f25aeb10f8ddcaf018a8412cb01a51bb074f29d9
#. default-sha256: 2cfd3af0a181a2225a57e75f3467db1b47af8e6b3e88cc0458bd121a4d1c5441
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4F66D0E7_51E8_426F_BC2E_44990B4B075A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a faithful servant of this house, and I would not, for the life of me, dare speak ill "
"of my master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sou uma serva fiel desta casa e não ousaria, por nada, me atrever a falar mal de meu mestre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEB9FDC0_046A_42EE_8B43_5C0C9C5589A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf19814a39413f96ae5378bba33cb35b9c8d147e4217df88a4b7af527dd72abb
#. default-sha256: 46429980dccee5af391a65d0193573ec4647a684961b7dbc9ebdcca0eeada0e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FEB9FDC0_046A_42EE_8B43_5C0C9C5589A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, this is a time long past. ⟪k:1⟫I imagine God would be so kind as to turn a blind "
"eye to a little bit of honesty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, este é um tempo passado. ⟪k:1⟫Imagino que Deus seria gentil a ponto de fechar os "
"olhos para um pouco de honestidade."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81DEF471_22C8_4193_B901_A06BB672C4BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fc7449b22352cfe02139ae2b5c3c7204954d293db004a0e051f38db85cb8d1e
#. default-sha256: b215e7d6690d2f7118d40a19de727eabd0750b2b2251df8ddb09e3bb7a0d081e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81DEF471_22C8_4193_B901_A06BB672C4BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was not terribly fond of my master back then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu não gostava muito de meu mestre naquela época."

#: scenario3:scenario3_20B2DA55_451B_4359_8C0B_D2005B3D1DDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 251cbc4af5d549c67c89d5f4746e10ba8f48398ea8a3e0363c83c225cc1ecd43
#. default-sha256: 664673098e4942f7a314778f56fe58f3798b3dc6967e87a2ada1e6cde1545b0b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_20B2DA55_451B_4359_8C0B_D2005B3D1DDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had wavy hair the color of over-dried tea leaves, a piercing gaze, an arrogant smile, and "
"he wore a hat that made him look rather haughty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele tinha cabelos ondulados da cor de folhas de chá secas demais, um olhar penetrante, um "
"sorriso arrogante e usava um chapéu que o fazia parecer um tanto orgulhoso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49BCB5BF_992C_4E26_9B8C_22DFED8E78E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d016d56f2bd423e95b071698cd798f4ec968466cd5e5bb5a45f8eb5a43515c29
#. default-sha256: 6efa549f2c0ea948412459d6e6681ab79f61339e7c86f429f2c7875196195d4a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49BCB5BF_992C_4E26_9B8C_22DFED8E78E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He put his trust only in money, renown, and rank. ⟪k:1⟫He loved only the iron and steel that "
"had revolutionized so many industries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele confiava apenas em dinheiro, renome e posição. ⟪k:1⟫Amava apenas o ferro e o aço que "
"revolucionaram tantas indústrias."

#: scenario3:scenario3_417C8F41_851A_4AAE_A018_3ACE20BBE061
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc2c545d38e57dfcbaf0c1bc342da6f3896598c47ecaf73339918f2ff6b1059a
#. default-sha256: ac90408eac4165d5906dfdbbb4a37ab18208b82a862ab6706d113baa799dc006
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_417C8F41_851A_4AAE_A018_3ACE20BBE061"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had not the slightest bit of love or care for other people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele não tinha o menor amor ou consideração por outras pessoas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECA0CD3B_8E6F_4843_9D9A_2760C8911005
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dbacaedeabaa65b9559211ae3d10c8024f6c26f0eae46e373644a5a76285bbe
#. default-sha256: 6dc655a944a02ce771a28384e7dff5f1886f84e8d5644ae34bd3d4ec5cd1f60a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECA0CD3B_8E6F_4843_9D9A_2760C8911005"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the very least, that is what I believed at the time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pelo menos, era isso que eu acreditava na época."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8D069546_106A_450D_821B_0182902A2190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cc5ef87a2faa0f05ec374887c43314ad04a6bb50d178e19fffe8cf155789bbd
#. default-sha256: 204fb90a3b57c45a241ad95ee0789ef8f2e1b8eedf384af8d1aa4b4576490ac2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8D069546_106A_450D_821B_0182902A2190"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Take a look around the room, Master. ⟪k:1⟫Jacopo had remodeled it into a recreation area."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dê uma olhada ao redor da sala, Mestre. ⟪k:1⟫Jacopo a remodelou para uma área de lazer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B09B01C_64CD_4BA4_B1EA_B31A4481408E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b17d834295d25bcdeec23db67d6e1903fbf9c43bc2233f0138ffe6dcfe33fb0
#. default-sha256: 2c7f583d38c75eaefcadde4866cf3c40b687a35eda35a4356b8a65e4006de38e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B09B01C_64CD_4BA4_B1EA_B31A4481408E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A billiards table sat in the center of the room, and the downward-facing lights hanging from "
"the ceiling were special-made."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma mesa de bilhar estava no centro da sala, e as luminárias voltadas para baixo penduradas "
"no teto foram especialmente feitas para isso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7051DB35_42B3_4571_830C_41BA1F25F41E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6ad784a7c240e24b3c50b9077635a9eea9b47d43e3e228372b24144522113da
#. default-sha256: cf9eefd94065a35c28b35d54f83aa7780582ddd129862437a9e97b071e6ffcf6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7051DB35_42B3_4571_830C_41BA1F25F41E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The lights shone upon the dark green stand like a stage. Cigars and bourbon lined glass "
"cases installed in place of bookshelves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As luzes brilhavam sobre a arquibancada verde-escura como um palco. Charutos e cristaleiras "
"revestidas de bourbon instaladas no lugar das estantes de livros."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A8CDD86_601E_4688_8A6B_6657465ACFCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fbaa0b84683e407bd29bd04531370418a3e88680fe2debbdc9f7f35c8ac5430
#. default-sha256: c03ea66cda5b8a17b48745bbb8006c1ef2795274203d21d270538ba421d7ab22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A8CDD86_601E_4688_8A6B_6657465ACFCC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cases were always fully stocked, their contents available to partake of readily. ⟪k:1⟫At "
"that particular moment, as he had many times before, Jacopo had invited several friends and "
"acquaintances, and they were entertaining themselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As cristaleiras estavam sempre totalmente abastecidas, seu conteúdo disponível para uso "
"imediato. ⟪k:1⟫Naquele momento, como muitas vezes antes, Jacopo havia convidado vários amigos e "
"conhecidos, e eles estavam se divertindo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37552AB0_63A9_4810_A76F_97FE22DA86AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb4b1bcc992166369e5e92dc15002da8c49b4c1b30a4531d2b59698ffea2f41f
#. default-sha256: 39507eb6c5ecfa36efc3cf0736cf24109180ab87ca69d936fc2313795c7794a0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37552AB0_63A9_4810_A76F_97FE22DA86AA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His wealthy, high-ranking acquaintances had a variety of hair colors: from polished brass to "
"the brown of a baby robin to the color of sunburnt wheat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seus conhecidos ricos e de alto escalão tinham uma variedade de cores de cabelo: de latão "
"polido ao marrom de um tordo bebê, até a cor do trigo queimado de sol."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3CD8BF7_8D14_46AE_B341_AE03FAC831A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0367ebfe8b2a67d7cc126a418da6644c7b105d9353a8e467091465241151c200
#. default-sha256: a56277692dfe251c57ebf45efae9cf44c7581bcdf5e19043882a9eeb9061282d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3CD8BF7_8D14_46AE_B341_AE03FAC831A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was also much greater variation in skin tone compared to the visitors and residents of "
"previous eras."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Havia também uma variação muito maior no tom de pele em comparação com os visitantes e "
"moradores de épocas anteriores."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A736809_12E0_4230_B5B3_7FE1CFF7E687
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc0b2f1a6235888d0a4e367f34770cd062cf83121a939fbaa2908fa81c2cd18b
#. default-sha256: b989d322b24bdbcf09d6018f6a73654ff92ae4d4051ac5dc6863106dbd547e29
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A736809_12E0_4230_B5B3_7FE1CFF7E687"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that was hardly any surprise, for the mansion sat upon land inhabited largely by "
"immigrants—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the New World."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas isso não era nenhuma surpresa, pois a mansão ficava em uma terra habitada em grande "
"parte por imigrantes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o Novo Mundo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B3130DE2_7D1A_45DF_9A81_B7476D740D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 316614adb2ec9ee453c3d723adc6600f9c032c8cec18b6da060d9105c951f229
#. default-sha256: ec4c243ea07ed2c6aac813b1d1e57f79e90ec8aafd4791633ac2a1d0d87f0667
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B3130DE2_7D1A_45DF_9A81_B7476D740D7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:4⟫What are you lookin’ at?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Qual é o problema?⟪k:4⟫Para o que você está olhando?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABFD0457_E718_47AD_AB2B_EBF09734F651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58594728b7094bf832caf85a70004022f4f3b9be0d4364a7c95bc9c1b5d249c7
#. default-sha256: ea5688ea8421cfe107148c4885fdc1f5b3d79b88aa9cf16f899b0a8b0ded6c4a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABFD0457_E718_47AD_AB2B_EBF09734F651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nothing.⟪k:2⟫I just thought I heard someone say my name."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nada.⟪k:2⟫Eu apenas pensei ter ouvido alguém dizer meu nome."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B2C6DB2_244C_4B8F_8C5F_BA81CCCB11EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 087107e621c90963e812f7835a93a9dc5b69f3ba59dac242c7bc75eeb2cfad98
#. default-sha256: 9b28ba149b85c6f001794854a7ddc01d29f63f405865176f589bf3a71a121357
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7B2C6DB2_244C_4B8F_8C5F_BA81CCCB11EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ain’t no one there, ’less you’re seein’ a ghost."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não há ninguém lá, a menos que você esteja vendo um fantasma."

#: scenario3:scenario3_58407D64_52AF_4FD1_8ABC_748EAA280E5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f27a13a155a0a3436f95ab86a987ac38a6f158bb4859f93156af741c2d765be0
#. default-sha256: 471cbe1783a9a8b8a3b5f4005bb104322a9e32a04716c6642d39cdedf5671027
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_58407D64_52AF_4FD1_8ABC_748EAA280E5E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t believe in such nonsense."
