msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫At the time, a great railway was being built across the breadth of "
"the continent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Na época, uma grande ferrovia estava sendo construída em toda a "
"extensão do continente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00f4446b6b5387962d5695f1ede81d40f025bf031100286260cf12a193d99f8f
#. default-sha256: b2b839e12b05157b04efe2c9a378804ff714c45a5448d007b2365b49e8ee3279
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Construction was spearheaded by two large rail companies, in competition for both prestige "
"and a bigger share of this massive national enterprise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A construção foi liderada por duas grandes empresas ferroviárias, competindo tanto pelo "
"prestígio quanto por uma fatia maior dessa gigantesca empreendimento nacional."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3db4018465970eda51c2e137f495c0bc4082190ab01692a35151df6a8145060c
#. default-sha256: c5424a4c50de9ca0ae406971615657e50eebd5fd0809b2558b315915afe094c3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Union Pacific Railroad Company started building from the east, and the Central Pacific "
"Railroad Company from the west."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A Union Pacific Railroad Company começou a construir do leste e a Central Pacific Railroad "
"Company do oeste."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b7db4120d1be15f632f87b21715177afea12f68305fab070db15fb2e658caca
#. default-sha256: 426a058d7fcf771065cddc116f53ae46d522f315cd06aa40debcce42793f4a32
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But government bonds alone were not enough to finance the massive undertaking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas os títulos do governo por si só não foram suficientes para financiar o empreendimento "
"maciço."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9d36ba512375565e2d61d778c11dab98abd6e7ca7a018defdc73c394e0f2d57
#. default-sha256: 43b23a0285b9498c38b05de8ef0ee5e116d5ce4042e6cda98fdf84a27679ca26
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By the way, there’ve been some less-than-pleasant reports about workers dyin’ on the job for "
"the company you chose—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Central Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A propósito, houve alguns relatos pouco agradáveis ​​sobre operários morrendo no trabalho para "
"a empresa que você escolheu—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Central Pacific."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c26d28b79582d21ba6ffef89372fad4aed2a2940337d75493bfb9fa9b681d498
#. default-sha256: 0ebff740d28e80cf799da2e046c0c84949dc2580926c9218eefa9ed030fc32c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, ya mean how they’re usin’ explosives to blast through the mountains? ⟪k:1⟫Makin’ quite "
"a bang, they are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, você quer dizer, sobre o fato de eles estarem usando explosivos para atravessar as "
"montanhas? ⟪k:1⟫Estão fazendo um grande estrondo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a09266149304165fe6cedbd61735127e052500f20e9fa2dd19e698d1d7bf22dc
#. default-sha256: 467cc21727bb2f125e98ea9bc83818a2634f762e1bcd736f5601c2f799695c58
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if this gets to be much bigger of a fix,⟪k:1⟫they’re not gonna be able to continue "
"construction.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You shoulda at least put your money in the more sure bet of the two—⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫the Union Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas se isso se tornar um problema muito grande,⟪k:1⟫eles não poderão continuar a construção."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Você deveria pelo menos colocar seu dinheiro na aposta mais segura das duas—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫a "
"Union Pacific."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dce4ed6c15c8b28f2798cb09f77873bf93ab734e55e26275dbfbd3ee6693a589
#. default-sha256: a32254aeb24a71016cdd62edcc9350bb62b22d29077820a8cd47aa84dec647ad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’ll cost ya to hire replacement workers, and if they keep kickin’ the bucket, you’re gonna "
"have trouble findin’ more—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vai custar-lhe contratar trabalhadores substitutos, e se eles continuarem chutando o balde, "
"você terá problemas para encontrar mais..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adfe53fcdfb41291c9de000983aa7f9d0ed6e2de7697f93ad18035185d79205b
#. default-sha256: d3b29a6f56ab314d69b83b26dabfa514f2cf9d85ba02489264068766818b09a0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My goodness.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And here I thought you all had spines."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Meu Deus.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E eu aqui pensando que vocês tinham colhões."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2eadb14aa409bf0e1be6b183d564971a3a22c5b689e2754768f1fcfab222e33d
#. default-sha256: d82865a4f9562b61ce58e4edcbb0035ae0eebbebbe4551ac0c197cee0ac13877
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You think we’re gonna run out of workers just because a few ate it? ⟪k:3⟫Hah. "
"There’re so many we don’t even know what to do with them all. ⟪k:4⟫There’s not a chance that well "
"will dry up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você acha que vamos ficar sem trabalhadores só porque alguns bateram as botas? "
"⟪k:3⟫Hah. São tantos que nem sabemos o que fazer com todos eles. ⟪k:4⟫ Não há risco de que esse "
"poço seque."

#: scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d13de268dfe438b5a388599d1096c7a51c84ef33461b5fa4dbddf14ac63fcf7
#. default-sha256: 9be14e0f118c0a30c3ddd31dee2752a838ee0353fd160b176afa913e9a29aa56
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And if, by some chance, it ⟪k:2⟫does⟪k:3⟫, all we have to do is scoop up a shipful of "
"blacks or yellows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E se, por acaso, ⟪k:2⟫secar⟪k:3⟫, tudo o que temos a fazer é pegar um navio cheio de "
"pretos ou amarelos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d8b1d68d5416710b971c5e82292e111e663dbda8d70df63ffed817273d29d92
#. default-sha256: 87c662a20ebaedd7563153d96e77f6831c134e2b5aff42fdd4815337253cfeaa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You won’t get anywhere if you spend your time worrying about a few measly laborers. ⟪k:1⟫"
"This is an endeavor backed by the entire nation.⟪k:2⟫Their deaths are honorable, in service of "
"their country."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você não chegará a lugar algum se gastar seu tempo se preocupando com alguns míseros "
"trabalhadores. ⟪k:1⟫Este é um esforço apoiado por toda a nação.⟪k:2⟫Suas mortes são honrosas, a "
"serviço de seu país."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30e042a3392607765a9448bbada1096fa76ae2b3a079a14e9db34a328b8d0fc2
#. default-sha256: f9175f87fb233368e7d5ff6e255e319a200d1d9481c6acc63731144aa3cbc635
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The biggest loss is not of people’s lives, but of ⟪k:2⟫time⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The longer a "
"project takes, the more money it costs,⟪k:6⟫and the less profit we make."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A maior perda não é a vida de pessoas, mas de ⟪k:2⟫tempo⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Quanto mais "
"tempo um projeto leva, mais dinheiro ele custa,⟪k:6⟫e menos lucro temos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd3ea8ade786d131e93ff37d4ba7943e56bb524a73a9a4b2308f35888c409f9d
#. default-sha256: eb66968d9b2093daf0dab92c357977a04e71e4c3b4570597d2fea46bacaa5c52
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What we seek is rapid progress,⟪k:2⟫even if the methods to obtain it are messy—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫or deadly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O que buscamos é um progresso rápido,⟪k:2⟫mesmo que os métodos para obtê-lo sejam "
"descuidados—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ou mortais."

