msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5C9354BC_4C69_44D9_9188_13AD9CA3D36B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you agree with his way of thinking, Master? ⟪k:1⟫Perhaps he ⟪k:2⟫does⟪k:3⟫ have a point, "
"in that great sacrifice is necessary to accomplish great things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você concorda com a maneira de pensar dele, Mestre? ⟪k:1⟫Talvez ele ⟪k:2⟫tenha⟪k:3⟫ um bom "
"argumento, de que grande sacrifício é necessário para realizar grandes coisas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B248FC95_2414_4629_BEDC_C071979861F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 299cf19b39f7479f94bb2eda7e5818efd7a7bf8a89a4f60faac0e9833f8f01ee
#. default-sha256: 655f9ae8095760ab600068381fe683fe0e55d3af813403d8a39e113f60a3ecca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B248FC95_2414_4629_BEDC_C071979861F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it ⟪k:1⟫is⟪k:2⟫ true that tragedy often lies in the shadows of the splendor of times "
"long past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E ⟪k:1⟫é⟪k:2⟫ verdade que a tragédia muitas vezes jaz nas sombras do esplendor de tempos "
"passados."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8EC68CFC_90A0_416A_A552_7BFA828EB5DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23f98b6db9211b27162c8c46461f6d97e82a7663949b735b0124914b66ae32dd
#. default-sha256: 8a4b594c9d52ec2dbc212b6769bed91bd4c090b93466ae66e14dc87e9f013d7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8EC68CFC_90A0_416A_A552_7BFA828EB5DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Furthermore, the way people see the world changes with the times,⟪k:1⟫so I hesitate to "
"criticize him too severely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Além disso, a forma como as pessoas veem o mundo muda com os tempos,⟪k:1⟫então hesito em "
"criticá-lo com muita severidade."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23D5714C_C893_476E_929E_01CEC85B734C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cec7b96e3078357a696969c0635d58df3abc8c43c2daea83c742525e381d46e1
#. default-sha256: 52dafab69f1c0b99d244572244b492742cf461da655d7aa9885abee6ff969567
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23D5714C_C893_476E_929E_01CEC85B734C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as I am sure you have already picked up on, he was an investor who had put money into a "
"railroad company."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agora, como tenho certeza que você já percebeu, ele era um investidor que havia colocado "
"dinheiro em uma empresa ferroviária."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A882DDAB_59EA_4E13_A84D_DF62EE1A6E57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e472b8cde90d15ed514c3e6540840b5b4ee469b94ea86b1dd6494561fc0281ca
#. default-sha256: b15ee178d6c71a21fa9b7eec74862a547e703f8a79a67c78d3b7114eb555e037
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A882DDAB_59EA_4E13_A84D_DF62EE1A6E57"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He also possessed several crude oil refineries, riding on the world’s second wave of "
"industrial development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele também possuía várias refinarias de petróleo bruto, aproveitando a segunda onda mundial "
"de desenvolvimento industrial."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1DA11088_1AC0_41B3_8B01_A37C9909C970
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad34df6ee5635cc9cdb0a8f4b53fbbbd1dd71a17b4490704ced10a6c5aa3e631
#. default-sha256: e87cb33712764f295b44c1824ba9947c9f607107f38dc2ca2b7b33d858a6f2b6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1DA11088_1AC0_41B3_8B01_A37C9909C970"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mansion too bustled with life, in a way it never had before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A mansão também fervilhava de vida, de forma como nunca antes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB2E2D3C_C4A0_4E41_A331_311470DD8B84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ee42142ab1732fbecfd33419a2885bd6e31117e9a28dbd098269e95d940078d
