msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB2E2D3C_C4A0_4E41_A331_311470DD8B84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dozens of maids—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫including me—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫gardeners, chefs, sculptors, artists..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dezenas de criadas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫incluindo eu—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫jardineiros, cozinheiros, escultores, "
"artistas..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79610573_7280_4181_B2CF_FE7FEB89901B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79047c8f78c1bc8df70e4158e0742ea1d4b8002dd463cb54dcbd10feedd57e1f
