msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she was not the same age and dressed differently, the White-Haired Girl—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"whom you saw fall into the hands of misfortune in the era of roses and the era of the beast—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫was also present in this era of innovation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora não tivesse a mesma idade e se vestisse de maneira diferente, a Garota de Cabelos "
"Brancos—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫que você viu cair nas mãos do infortúnio na era das rosas e na era da fera—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫também esteve presente nesta era de inovação."

